    "description": "<p>When ghosts and the walking dead linger on in the lands of the living, it falls upon Saturn's Chosen to guide them back to their ordained endings. Smooth Transition can supplement any attack against a creature of death, causing it to deal aggravated damage and adding one automatic success to the damage roll. Undead extras hit by the attack are automatically destroyed: zombies fall apart as they remember that they are dead, while ghosts pass peacefully into Lethe.</p>",
